<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-KREDIIDIPANK ISSUES 2-YEAR BONDS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-KREDIIDIPANK ISSUES 2-YEAR BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krediidipank, one of the smallest Estonian commercial banks, issued 20 million kroons of two-year bonds on Friday, Uhispank said.</p>
<p>The bonds yield 10.1 percent, Uhispank money market manager Andres Ojamaa told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
